**`styles\Projects.css`** *(62 lines)*
```css
#projects {
    padding: 70px 0;
    background: #001936;
    text-align: center;
}

.section-title {
    font-size: 60px;
    color: #107eb1;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
}

.projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    grid-gap: 20px;
}

.project-item {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.project-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    object-fit: cover;
}

.project-link {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    background-color: #1c6f96;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-top: 15px;
}

.sophisticated-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 15px 35px;
    border: 2px solid #107eb1;
    color: #107eb1;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.sophisticated-btn:hover {
    background: #107eb1;
    color: white;
}

/* Gallery Parts */
.gallery-section { padding: 50px 0; background: #001936; color: white; }
.gallery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.gallery-item { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; }
.gallery-item img { width: 100%; transition: 0.3s; }
.gallery-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.1); }
```

